((*- extends 'cedt-assignment.tex.j2' -*))
((=
    The template body lives in cedt-assignment.tex.j2 so that variants can
    extend it by that unique name: a variant (e.g. cedt-assignment-plain) sets
    "base_template": "cedt-assignment", which puts this directory on its search
    path, but `extends 'index.tex.j2'` from the variant would resolve to its own
    index.tex.j2 first.
=))
